#### 2.1.4 Vehicle State Information

There is also proprioceptive information describing the current dynamic state of the ego-vehicle [[149](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2512.16760v2#bib.bib149), [17](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2512.16760v2#bib.bib17)]: 𝐱state∈ℝDstate\mathbf{x}\_{\mathrm{state}}\in\mathbb{R}^{D\_{\mathrm{state}}}, where DstateD\_{\mathrm{state}} is the dimension of the state vector, including speed, acceleration, steering angle, yaw rate, turn indicator status, etc.

𝐱state∈ℝDstate\mathbf{x}_{\mathrm{state}}\in\mathbb{R}^{D_{\mathrm{state}}}

